OL,3,GNEWSAThe derelict bowling club at the  
OL,4,Aheart of Scotland's urban green space  
OL,5,Adebate                                 
OL,7,FCovered in overgrown grass and with a  
OL,8,Fhandful of abandoned folding chairs,   
OL,9,Fthe grounds of Corunna Bowling         
OL,10,FClubhouse in Glasgow are unassuming on 
OL,11,Ffirst glance.                          
OL,13,FYet the area is at the heart of a      
OL,14,Fbitter dispute that could affect all of
OL,15,FScotland's urban green spaces - the    
OL,16,Fparks, playing fields and allotments   
OL,17,Fthat are so important to communities.  
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
