OL,3,GNEWSAThe derelict bowling club at the  
OL,4,Aheart of Scotland's urban green space  
OL,5,Adebate                                 
OL,7,FPrevious bids to build on the site were
OL,8,Frejected, but Glasgow City Council     
OL,9,Fapproved plans in March for 20 flats to
OL,10,Fbe built there, despite council        
OL,11,Fofficers recommending refusal.         
OL,13,FCampaigners argue the decision went    
OL,14,Fagainst Scottish government and council
OL,15,Fguidelines aimed at protecting green   
OL,16,Fspaces.                                
